  "link_conversions": {
    "_comment": "Markdown-link substring -> replacement. Applied via simple substring replace. Handles the source-side .md filename references AND the inline-code variant. The script sorts by length descending so longer patterns replace before shorter substrings they'd be a prefix of (so `(design/changelog.md)` fires before `(changelog.md)`).",

    "_comment_path_prefixed": "Path-prefixed forms used by home.md (linking from .minecraft/wiki/ root to subdirectories).",
